==============================================================================
ScopeGuard - Environment Configuration Template
Copy this file to .env and fill in the values for local development.
==============================================================================
Server

PORT=5000
NODE_ENV=development

Frontend URL used for CORS

CLIENT_URL=http://localhost:5173

MongoDB

MONGODB_URI=

Optional DNS resolver override for MongoDB Atlas

MONGODB_OVERRIDE_DNS=false

JWT

JWT_SECRET=
JWT_EXPIRES_IN=7d

Legacy/client session secret if required by the existing application

SESSION_SECRET=

Google OAuth

GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=

Gmail OAuth callback

GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:5000/api/gmail/oauth/callback

Gemini API

GEMINI_API_KEY=